{"1446340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shaype", "steam_appid": 1446340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446340/extras/38dcd3c4b6654634f6ad84681784e51f.avif?t=1768354530\" width=615 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shaype</i></strong> is a singleplayer fantasy action role-playing game which emphasizes player agency while combining engaging action combat with flexible RPG character progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446340/extras/8b17a0f453bda202e231be18b353c12d.avif?t=1768354530\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Agency and Reactivity</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Shaype</strong></i> offers multiple resolutions to the problems of diverse characters in a reactive world, rewarding imagination and creativity through versatile player-driven outcomes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shaype's</i></strong> combat was designed to be easy to learn but hard to master, testing the ability of the player to problem solve and find openings to strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shaype</i></strong><i> </i>features angled melee combat, ranged combat, stealth, abilities, and an in-depth spell crafting system for magic.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shaype</i></strong> presents an open-ended progression system which supports the mixing and matching of typical RPG playstyles. Build your character however you wish.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shaype</i></strong><i> </i>is set in the inhospitable land of Paradise. Build reputation with the competing factions and settlements that tensely share this harsh and violent land.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit us on our website and join our Discord to learn more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446340/extras/1c9e06ba6aaf6221e09e306a800f3686.avif?t=1768354530\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446340/extras/38dcd3c4b6654634f6ad84681784e51f.avif?t=1768354530\" width=615 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shaype</i></strong> is a singleplayer fantasy action role-playing game which emphasizes player agency while combining engaging action combat with flexible RPG character progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446340/extras/8b17a0f453bda202e231be18b353c12d.avif?t=1768354530\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Agency and Reactivity</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Shaype</strong></i> offers multiple resolutions to the problems of diverse characters in a reactive world, rewarding imagination and creativity through versatile player-driven outcomes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shaype's</i></strong> combat was designed to be easy to learn but hard to master, testing the ability of the player to problem solve and 